# Context filter for deploy/containers/repro/Dockerfile.
#
# This image needs the zome sources, the packaging script and the hash registry,
# which the repository-wide .dockerignore (a whitelist for the daemon image)
# excludes. Build artifacts and VCS data are still irrelevant here.
.git
.github
**/target
**/node_modules
**/*.wasm
**/*.dna
**/*.happ
deploy/secrets
site
visualizer
qwen3-codegen
spike-android
spike-android-gpu
spike-windows
